  "content": {
    "title": "观看警示教育片《永远在路上》主题党日暨《牢记初心、不忘使命》主题教育活动",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-06-18",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">为认真贯彻落实党中央、省委和教育厅关于“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育的意见要求，中共吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支多次开展理论学习活动，认真全面学习传达习近平总书记、巴音朝鲁书记、李晓杰厅长等关于“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育的讲话精神和习近平总书记系列讲话精神。在多次文件学习的基础上，于<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">2019年6月18日开展“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题党日活动。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/a57e56764d727c8f5bcb539661bc57378d5b60b45ebc7d43e4f908cbde09519a.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/c0f17473c3c8a5944b0409220386717a02deeef885dae2851be03d9301dd535b.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.2500pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">这次主题党日活动以“不忘初心、牢记使命”为主题，具体内容是观看警示教育片《永远在路上》第一集《人心向背》。<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(25,25,25); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;=\"\" background:rgb(255,255,255);mso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);\"=\"\">通过《永远在路上》对典型案例的剖析，讲述监督执纪故事，深刻反映了党的十八大以来以习近平同志为总书记的党中央坚持依法治党、从严治党，坚定不移推进党风廉政建设和反腐败斗争，把党风廉政建设和反腐败斗争作为全面从严治党的重要内容，以旗帜鲜明的政治立场、坚强无畏的政治勇气、坚韧不拔的政治定力，强化正风肃纪，纠正“四风”，着力构建不敢腐、不能腐、不想腐的体制机制，管党治党取得了显著成效，反腐败斗争压倒性态势已经形成，具有很强的警示教育意义。正如<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">习近平总书记在《省部级主要领导干部学习贯彻党的十八届四中全会精神全面推进依法治国专题研讨班上的讲话》中指出，法治之下，任何人都不能心存侥幸，都不能指望法外施恩，没有免罪的“丹书铁券”，也没有“铁帽子王”。党的十八大以来，反腐败斗争的一大看点，就是“反腐无例外，刑要上大夫”。<spanyes';font-family:color:\\#333333\\;;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">&nbsp;<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">《永远在路上》深刻体现了我党坚定不移惩治腐败的鲜明态度，体现了党纪国法面前人人平等的原则，也充分显示了猛药去疴、重典治乱的决心，刮骨疗毒、壮士断腕的勇气。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);></spanyes';font-family:color:\\#333333\\;;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(51,51,51);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(25,25,25);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 3\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 4\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 5\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 6\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 7\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 8\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 9\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 3\" ><